 {
  "kind": "python",
  "title": "Python 汽车购买预测（逻辑回归）",
  "category": "智能训练",
  "points": 16,
  "source": "官方样题 实操二",
  "prompt": "某汽车公司收集了用户预估薪资与是否购买新款豪华汽车的数据（data.csv，字段：预估薪资、是否会购买）。请用 Python 完成数据处理与算法测试。\n要求变量名：data、X、y、X_train、X_test、y_train、y_test、model、accuracy、y_pred：\n① 读取 data.csv；② 查看 head(15) 与 describe()；\n③ 预处理：处理缺失值、重复值；④ 划分特征 X 与标签 y；\n⑤ 按 8:2 随机划分训练集与测试集（random_state=2020）；\n⑥ 将训练/测试特征转为二维数组；⑦ 定义逻辑回归模型并训练；\n⑧ 输出测试集准确度 accuracy 与预测值 y_pred。",
  "meta": {
   "preload": "预估薪资,是否会购买\n95861,1\n81024,0\n46476,0\n92869,1\n186640,1\n115638,1\n117040,1\n74921,0\n89986,0\n199187,1\n38717,0\n186455,1\n160021,1\n84175,1\n141178,1\n90765,0\n166001,1\n199467,1\n34663,0\n28414,0\n102694,1\n90186,1\n75307,0\n168682,1\n,1\n191819,1\n123712,1\n188519,1\n57452,0\n56603,0\n167159,1\n88876,0\n173245,1\n172969,1\n114895,1\n56262,0\n149372,1\n32351,0\n48743,0\n150000,1\n198384,1\n176345,1\n120864,1\n176208,1\n158704,1\n165024,1\n23009,0\n50029,0\n150000,1",
   "checkpoints": [
    {
     "label": "① 读取 data.csv 数据集（变量名 data）",
     "code": "assert isinstance(data, pd.DataFrame) and data.shape[1] == 2",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "② 缺失值处理：清洗后无缺失",
     "code": "assert data.isna().sum().sum() == 0",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "③ 重复值处理：清洗后无重复行",
     "code": "assert len(data.drop_duplicates()) == len(data)",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "④ 划分特征 X 与标签 y（y 为「是否会购买」）",
     "code": "assert len(X) == len(y) and ('薪资' in str(X.name) or '薪资' in str(getattr(X,'columns','')))",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "⑤ 按 8:2 随机划分训练集/测试集",
     "code": "assert 0.7 <= len(X_train)/(len(X_train)+len(X_test)+0.0) <= 0.9 and len(y_train)+len(y_test) == len(X)",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "⑥ 训练/测试特征转为二维数组",
     "code": "assert X_train.ndim == 2 and X_train.shape[1] == 1 and X_test.ndim == 2 and X_test.shape[1] == 1",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "⑦ 定义逻辑回归模型并完成训练",
     "code": "assert hasattr(model, 'predict') and hasattr(model, 'coef_')",
     "points": 2
    },
    {
     "label": "⑧ 输出准确度 accuracy 与预测值 y_pred",
     "code": "assert 0 <= accuracy <= 1 and len(y_pred) == len(X_test)",
     "points": 2
    }
   ]
  }
